        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="PARTIAL_SCOPE_OR_ACCEPTANCE. Whole-booking completion/credit/event provenance is required. No source-time feature backfill or immediate public comment. Customer seven-day rating window is an explicit SRS gap; the separate sitter-to-customer service window is not proof for this direction. Sources: backend/src/services/reviews/review.service.js; backend/src/services/reviews/mongo-customer-review.repository.js; backend/src/models/customer-review.model.js; backend/src/services/ai-training/dataset-export.service.js" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
